  "description_short": "The sophisticated 14-hole Country course calls for relaxed rounds throughout the week, and for a quick round during busy times while captivate players with its equally perfect condition as Diamond Country Club's championship-length European Tour course.",
  "description_long": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Diamond Country Club, located in Atzenbrugg, Austria, is one of the premier golfing destinations in Europe. This world-class golf resort offers a golfing experience set amidst beautiful natural surroundings, with impeccably maintained fairways, greens, and water features."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Designed by Jeremy Pern, Diamond Country Club features three courses: the championship-length 18-hole Diamond course, and its two smaller brothers, the 14-hole Country and 9-hole Park courses. Each course provides unique challenges and stunning views, making for a diverse and engaging round of golf. Each layout includes wide fairways, strategically placed bunkers, and water hazards that demand precise shot-making and thoughtful strategy."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The sophisticated 14-hole Country course calls for relaxed rounds throughout the week, and for a quick round during busy times while captivate players with its equally perfect condition as Diamond Country Club's championship-length European Tour course."
    }
  ],
